(text "18/26 GPIO used; eight spare including GP26-28, all physically NC.\nBUSY/IRQ/CS are direct GPIO through fixed-direction isolation, not expander GPIO.\nKEY: captive M3 x 25 alignment post, see radio-slot-v0.1.md.\nU4 GPA0..5 = S1/S3/S4 TX,RX pairs; GPB0..3 = S1..4 RESET_N.\nNo autonomous duty-cycled RX or automatic TX/RX transitions on Ebyte cards." (at 20.32 535 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cea10baf-084b-5bcd-9571-522e1521425a"))
(text "USB-only: Q1 off; RADIO_5V and IOREF_3V3 unpowered. External power: U2 -> radios and Q1 -> VSYS.\nQ1 orientation is intentional: body diode from RADIO_5V toward VSYS. Pico onboard D1 blocks USB backfeed.\n#FLG01/#FLG02 model the external supply; #FLG03 models real Q1/onboard USB-D1 ORing output.\nU2 AUXOFF/FLT/ITIMER unused per datasheet. Leave ITIMER open for fastest current limiting." (at 425 535 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2532d58e-f5a6-5501-8ba1-5f95b7aee2b5"))
